Clinical Course: The expected natural course is a prolonged, benign state with a very low annual risk of progression, heavily favoring routine "watch and wait" surveillance over immediate invasive therapies.

SAFETY-NETTING ADVICE

Seek immediate emergency attention if you develop profound new fatigue, unexplained severe bone pain, or persistent vomiting.

